        <title>Dashy Dango</title>
        <published>2022-08-01T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2022-08-01T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            William Guimont-Martin
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/"/>
        <id>https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/">&lt;p&gt;Dashy Dango a wave fighting game made with &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://wasm4.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WASM-4&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/samX500&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@samX500&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/willGuimont&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@willGuimont&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://willguimont.github.io/dashy-dango/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Try the game here&lt;/a&gt; or on &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://willguimont.itch.io/dashy-dango&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;itch.io&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/DashyDangolong.webp&quot; alt=&quot;dash dango&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Source code is here: &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/willGuimont/dashy-dango&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;willGuimont/dashy-dango&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We built our own ECS (entity-component-systems) from scratch in Rust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More screenshots:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/dashy_1.webp&quot; alt=&quot;screenshot 1&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; /&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/dashy_2.webp&quot; alt=&quot;screenshot 2&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; /&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://willguimont.com/blog/dashy-dango/dashy_3.webp&quot; alt=&quot;screenshot 3&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
        
